      "tag": "Indices",
      "h2": "Powers come second",
      "body_html": "<p>Evaluate <strong>3 + 2²</strong>.</p><p>Indices first: 2² = 4.</p><p>Then add: 3 + 4 = <strong>7</strong>.</p>"
    },
    {
      "tag": "Mixed",
      "h2": "Mixing brackets and indices",
      "body_html": "<p>Evaluate <strong>(3 + 1)² − 5</strong>.</p><p>Brackets first: 3 + 1 = 4.</p><p>Indices: 4² = 16.</p><p>Subtract: 16 − 5 = <strong>11</strong>.</p>"
    },
    {
      "tag": "Same Level",
      "h2": "Left to right for same level",
      "body_html": "<p>Evaluate <strong>12 ÷ 4 × 3</strong>.</p><p>Division and multiplication are same level — work left to right.</p><p>12 ÷ 4 = 3, then 3 × 3 = <strong>9</strong>.</p>"
    }
